# What everything after PID 1's own services runs under: the role's mounts, and
# nothing root could change without a capability — the kernel's settings,
# /sys, the root filesystem and PID 1's control socket — left changeable. The
# clock keeper, and with it the application, start only after.
type = internal
depends-on: mounts
depends-on: proc-sys-ro
depends-on: sys-ro
depends-on: root-ro
